WEBVTT

00:00.300 --> 00:09.000
Open Settings, then Updates. Tap Download and install.

00:09.000 --> 00:23.000
Android asks if you want to update the app. Tap Update.

00:23.000 --> 00:31.000
Play Protect may ask to scan it, because HQ is not on the Play Store.

00:31.000 --> 00:36.000
More details shows every choice.

00:36.500 --> 00:38.500
Tap Scan app.

00:38.500 --> 00:46.500
The scan takes a few seconds.

00:46.500 --> 00:53.400
It looks safe. Tap Install.
